Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.30,0:00:04.55,italics,computer,0,0,0,,House in Akisaki Komagane-cho \Ncompletely destroyed by fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.55,0:00:07.19,italics,computer,0,0,0,,Homicide by arson. No reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.59,0:00:10.53,italics,computer,0,0,0,,Ootemon Building, \Nhigh-value target eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.53,0:00:13.49,italics,computer,0,0,0,,Currently under a media blackout.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.49,0:00:16.08,italics,computer,0,0,0,,Pier 2, warehouse 7…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.08,0:00:20.75,italics,computer,0,0,0,,Guest in room 306's assignment:\Ncomplete. No reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.85,0:00:24.19,main,Sara,0,0,0,,This is Haizaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.19,0:00:27.26,main,Sara,0,0,0,,How is the follow-up service progressing \Nfor Machinami-sama in room 306?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.26,0:00:29.95,italics,Roy,0,0,0,,The clean-up crew is already on site.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.95,0:00:32.76,italics,Roy,0,0,0,,Our guest is returning to \Nthe hotel without assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.26,0:00:35.60,italics,Roy,0,0,0,,Estimated time of arrival: two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.60,0:00:37.73,main,Sara,0,0,0,,Understood. I will remain on standby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:43.33,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Well, Sara-senpai, I'll be on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.61,0:00:47.77,main,Ikuro,0,0,0,,Oh, Koshiba-san.\NAre you done for the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.08,0:00:51.38,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,I heard that the guest in \Nroom 306, Machinami-sama,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.38,0:00:53.49,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,will be back in an hour and a half.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:00:55.33,main,Ikuro,0,0,0,,Oh. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.80,0:00:57.12,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Don't slack off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.59,0:00:59.38,main,Ikuro,0,0,0,,Uh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.38,0:01:00.47,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.47,0:01:02.60,main,Ikuro,0,0,0,,Um, good work today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.97,0:01:21.66,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Ugh. The price of cigarettes \Nwent up again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.45,0:01:24.56,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Seriously, what's up \Nwith the cost of living?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.09,0:01:26.73,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Can't we catch a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.55,0:01:28.87,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Uh-huh…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.87,0:01:30.90,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Number 27, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.90,0:01:32.07,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.07,0:01:34.57,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H3619F2&\fnImpact\3c&H2D2D2D&\t(0,1685,\fs18)\bord0.25\frz357.9\frx24\fry24\move(436.667,249.334,466,222,0,1685)}Staff {\c&H29FF37&}Pick!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.07,0:01:34.57,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\bord0.25\c&H3218ED&\t(0,1685,\fs18)\frx4\fry16\move(305.333,319.333,362,278.667,0,1685)}Character {\c&H22FF35&}Raffle
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.07,0:01:34.57,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs15\fnImpact\bord0.25\t(0,1685,\fs13)\frx4\fry14\frz356.6\c&H4F30ED&\3c&H433673&\move(144.667,63.333,229.333,74,0,1685)}Assassin\NDetective
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.04,0:01:34.57,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,And one try at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.87,0:01:35.97,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,This one, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.69,0:01:37.37,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\fnImpact\bord0.25\c&H3219DB&\frz300.2\pos(438.667,168.667)\frx12\fry10}Character{\c&H28ED33&} Raffle
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.29,0:01:37.35,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.89,0:01:41.00,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,I forgot my wallet!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.84,0:01:44.84,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Which one do I buy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.82,0:01:48.23,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.23,0:01:50.88,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,You must really like {\i1}Assassin Detective{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.88,0:01:54.04,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Huh? No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.04,0:01:54.76,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.76,0:01:57.18,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H2E11DE&\fnImpact\3c&H2D2D2D&\bord0.25\pos(394,280.667)\frx30\fry24\frz355.4}Staff {\c&H22F32F&}Pick!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.76,0:01:57.18,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\bord0.25\c&H3218ED&\pos(262,328.667)\frx2\fry16}Character {\c&H22FF35&}Raffle
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.76,0:01:57.18,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs15\fnImpact\bord0.25\frx4\fry14\frz356.6\c&H4F30ED&\3c&H433673&\pos(119.333,88)}Assassin\NDetective
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.13,0:01:57.18,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,The display looked cute, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.64,0:02:01.88,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,I just can't resist cute things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.88,0:02:04.10,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Hmm… What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.11,0:02:10.94,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I'm not giving it to you. It's a loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.95,0:02:17.41,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I'm the one who drew that display, \Nso I'm taking responsibility for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.87,0:02:24.13,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,That brings back memories. \NI used to be like that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.71,0:02:31.57,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Matsuki-san, you shouldn't \Nlend money that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.15,0:02:36.06,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,So, this 500 yen…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.06,0:02:38.60,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Will you lend it to me until \Nthe whole raffle's done?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.60,0:02:40.71,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Sure, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.44,0:02:42.95,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,I'm out of cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.93,0:02:48.27,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I don't even know your name. \NI'm not getting on a bike with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.45,0:02:52.14,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Everyone I know calls me Koshiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.49,0:02:54.95,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,And you're… Matsuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.77,0:02:59.83,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.83,0:03:01.41,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\t(2811,3270,\blur2)\bord0\b1\fs12\c&H1D2F20&\3c&H29492F&\frz41.34\pos(132.666,64.666)}D Prize Plushie
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.41,0:03:03.59,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Let's just pretend it's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.35,0:03:05.54,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Hikaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.03,0:03:09.63,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Hikaru Matsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.45,0:03:13.76,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Have you always been good at drawing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.95,0:03:17.08,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I don't know about way back, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.39,0:03:21.09,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,my big sister complimented me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.66,0:03:24.24,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Hey! Ikuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.24,0:03:26.65,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,I told you not to touch those!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:34.40,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I just came back from a \Ncremation. My older sister's.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.61,0:03:39.49,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I'm in mourning clothes, \Nso it's hard to ask, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.65,0:03:42.84,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,So I told you everything myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.92,0:03:45.97,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.97,0:03:49.25,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I already knew we didn't \Nhave much time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.25,0:03:51.17,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,And I've been preparing this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.78,0:03:55.07,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,But when the cremation \Nwas over and I went home…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.44,0:03:58.02,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I didn't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.70,0:04:03.11,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Take me to the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.64,0:04:05.64,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,The wind feels so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.06,0:04:08.77,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Hey! Why the ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.77,0:04:10.56,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,The picture diary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.56,0:04:11.44,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.44,0:04:13.04,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,The picture diary!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:15.54,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,When we were kids, my sister and I
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.54,0:04:18.15,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,used a picture diary \Nas an exchange diary!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.15,0:04:22.16,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,It ended on a day we went to the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.12,0:04:28.85,main,Sara,0,0,0,,Understood. We will undertake \Nthe care of your younger sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.85,0:04:33.17,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,And I want to remember \Nwhy we stopped there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.31,0:04:38.39,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Well, I can't ask her about the \Npicture diary anymore, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.88,0:04:47.31,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I'll buy you a coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.61,0:04:56.23,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Sara-senpai, thank you \Nfor taking over my late shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.93,0:05:01.35,main,Sara,0,0,0,,I'll leave it to you, Koshiba…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.45,0:05:06.74,main,Sara,0,0,0,,to fulfill the dying service that \Nhired killer Mitsuru Matsuki-sama
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.31,0:05:09.81,italics,Sara,0,0,0,,gifted to her younger sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.84,0:05:18.96,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HE3E6E4&\bord0\blur0.25\b1\fnTimes New Roman\an1\fs15\pos(150,235.6)}Not human; like a monster
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.84,0:05:18.96,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HE3E6E4&\bord0\blur0.25\b1\fnTimes New Roman\an1\fs15\pos(150,275.4)}Lacking human kindness or weakness
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.84,0:05:18.96,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HE3E6E4&\bord0\blur0.25\b1\fnTimes New Roman\an1\fs15\pos(150,319.6)}Ruthless; cruel
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.84,0:05:18.96,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HE8EBE9&\blur0.5\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs40\bord0\pos(320,60)}Inhuman
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.26,0:06:53.31,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HFBFEFE&\3c&H282925&\bord0.1\shad0.5\blur1\b1\fnTimes New Roman\an1\fade(439,437)\pos(209,318.333)}Motorcycle Diaries 2
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.29,0:06:57.56,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Now I feel warmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.54,0:07:02.32,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,So is this place we're going to up ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.96,0:07:06.32,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Yeah, just keep going straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.65,0:07:08.88,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,There's a parking lot along the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.79,0:07:38.40,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,This is it. Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.74,0:07:41.00,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.03,0:07:43.98,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,We made it, Koshiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.03,0:07:47.38,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.03,0:07:49.75,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,But, you know…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.41,0:07:52.60,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,It's freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.02,0:07:56.80,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,And this wind is insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.15,0:08:00.80,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,You sure this is the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.80,0:08:03.52,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,You were still little the last \Ntime you came here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.42,0:08:19.09,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm sure this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.23,0:08:30.08,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,If you want to go down to the beach, \NI'll park the bike here and—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.08,0:08:31.47,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,It's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.37,0:08:36.66,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I know this is the right place, \Nbut I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.93,0:08:43.70,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Why did we stop using the picture diary?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.41,0:08:50.30,italics,young Hikaru,0,0,0,,We finally arrived at the beach \NI've been looking forward to!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.30,0:08:54.66,italics,young Hikaru,0,0,0,,It's already nighttime today, but \Ntomorrow we're going to swim lots!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.13,0:08:58.02,italics,young Hikaru,0,0,0,,I wonder if I'll meet any fishies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.13,0:08:58.02,top,Koshiba,0,0,0,,"I wonder if I'll meet any fishies."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.02,0:09:01.22,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't look at other people's \Ndiaries without permission!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.22,0:09:04.64,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Hmm. It looks like you were \Nhaving fun up to that point.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.64,0:09:05.78,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.78,0:09:09.32,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Yeah. The next page is torn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.03,0:09:11.57,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I wonder why.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.27,0:09:15.67,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Did you write about the day \Nafter you came to this beach?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.65,0:09:18.29,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.20,0:09:25.21,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,The smell of the salt air is nostalgic, \Nbut it's not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.22,0:09:37.63,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs8\bord0.5\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H5A2F3B&\3c&H622C35&\t(0,4934,\c&H372431&)\frz329.8\frx16\fry0\move(403.333,130,500.333,372.667,0,5398)}Picture Diary
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.88,0:09:39.93,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,The thing is, there's more to \Nwhy I want to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.46,0:09:46.73,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,They said my sister was \Nreading this on her last day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.73,0:09:46.73,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\t(0,3000,\fs13)\bord0\fnComic Sans MS\c&H555969&\frz24.94\move(366.666,263.334,368.667,271.333,0,2981)}Mitsuru, Hikaru Matsuki
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.73,0:09:46.73,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\t(0,3000,\fs13)\bord0.5\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H5955BE&\3c&H6D6AA9&\frz23.71\move(275.333,112,270,106.667,0,2981)}Picture Diary
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.23,0:09:51.24,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs15\bord0\fnComic Sans MS\c&H2A2323&\pos(275.333,318)\frz339.9}Mitsuru, Hikaru Matsuki
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.23,0:09:51.24,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs15\bord0.5\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H642F40&\3c&H47202A&\frz342.7\pos(352,92)\frx14\fry2}Picture Diary
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.88,0:09:51.24,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.24,0:09:54.03,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,if I still can't remember…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.03,0:09:56.74,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,maybe that means it's okay if I don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.54,0:10:08.55,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\c&HFDFEEC&\bord0\fs8\frz350.2\frx10\fry2\move(365.333,65.333,365.333,46.667,0,2984)}Today
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.54,0:10:08.54,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\c&HFDFEEC&\bord0\fs8\frx10\fry2\frz348.8\move(358.666,92.666,358.666,73,0,3000)}Unread Messages Below
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.54,0:10:08.54,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\c&HFDFEEC&\bord0\fs8\frx10\fry2\frz348.8\move(250.666,101.333,250.666,82,0,3000)}Aunt
