Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.46,0:10:12.06,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an4\b1\fs10\3c&HB6FE6E&\c&HA29F3F&\frz350\fad(233,50)\pos(252,150.668)}I'm sure your big sister
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.09,0:10:14.22,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(104,0)\an4\b1\fs10\3c&HB6FE6E&\c&HA29F3F&\frz350\pos(274,33.334)}Hikaru-chan, thank you for\Nhanging in there all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.11,0:10:14.22,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an4\b1\fs10\3c&HB6FE6E&\c&HA29F3F&\frz350\fad(84,0)\pos(263.333,89.335)}I'm sure your big sister
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.22,0:10:14.22,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an4\b1\fs10\3c&HB6FE6E&\c&HA29F3F&\fad(225,0)\pos(252,153.668)\frz349.5}was happy right up to the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.57,0:10:21.53,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Hikaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.80,0:10:25.46,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,It's hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.52,0:10:30.94,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,All these people who didn't \Nhelp us one little bit
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.32,0:10:34.84,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,are saying whatever they want \Nabout my sister. Must be nice, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.57,0:10:38.58,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Back when the two of us ended up alone…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.10,0:10:42.20,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,and when we found out about \Nmy sister's illness, too…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.57,0:10:45.60,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,They wrapped it up neatly as a sad story,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.60,0:10:49.46,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,and they were satisfied with that, \Nso they were able to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.46,0:10:51.88,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs25\bord0.5\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H493047&\frz287.1\pos(406.667,298)}Picture Diary
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.77,0:10:53.13,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,So…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:51.96,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs25\bord0.5\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H493047&\frz287.1\pos(406,310)}Picture Diary
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.96,0:10:52.04,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs25\bord0.5\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H493047&\frz287.1\pos(404,314.667)}Picture Diary
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.04,0:10:52.13,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs25\bord0.5\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H493047&\frz287.1\pos(405.334,321.333)}Picture Diary
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.13,0:10:53.13,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs25\bord0.5\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H493047&\frz287.1\pos(405.334,324.666)}Picture Diary
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.00,0:10:59.05,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,What about me? \NEven if I wanted to forget, I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.14,0:11:03.97,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,You know, I… I…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.67,0:11:09.64,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,When my sister was bedridden, \NI stood next to her
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.64,0:11:13.36,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,and I whispered, "Give me a break." \NWhat about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.76,0:11:15.28,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,And when she died…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.28,0:11:18.68,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,When she died, part of me \Nwas relieved. What about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.53,0:11:22.42,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I thought, "I don't have to \Nlook after her anymore."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.42,0:11:24.57,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,"It's finally over."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.98,0:11:26.79,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,What about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.78,0:11:30.01,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,That's why…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.46,0:11:37.09,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,That's why I…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.76,0:11:52.52,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I painted because \NI wanted to forget, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.20,0:11:58.26,flashback,Hikaru,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.19,0:12:03.42,flashback,Mitsuru,0,0,0,,This might be…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.42,0:12:08.17,flashback,Mitsuru,0,0,0,,my last time… coming home…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.17,0:12:14.59,flashback,Mitsuru,0,0,0,,Hey… That painting…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.92,0:12:15.96,flashback,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Painting?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.58,0:12:17.73,flashback,Mitsuru,0,0,0,,Show it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.26,0:12:23.93,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I wasn't planning to show \Nit to her at all, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.35,0:12:27.02,flashback,Mitsuru,0,0,0,,Please… show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.78,0:12:43.41,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I did it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.26,0:12:47.41,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,To force that never-changing\Nday-to-day out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.77,0:12:50.79,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,To bleach my sullied emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.01,0:12:54.12,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,To forget everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.35,0:12:58.40,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,That's why I painted my sister's ending…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.93,0:13:11.65,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,but even if I wanted to forget, \NI can't forget anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.38,0:13:22.65,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.62,0:13:31.78,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Don't let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.78,0:13:33.45,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Hikaru, we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.45,0:13:34.90,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,What? But…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.75,0:13:38.71,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Hang on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.71,0:13:40.01,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Koshiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.52,0:13:47.47,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Koshiba, this is too fast! It's too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.47,0:13:51.52,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,You know, I absolutely hate \Nsweet, sappy stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.57,0:13:55.80,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,The more I listen, \Nthe more irritated I get.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.44,0:14:01.53,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,I mean, what more could you have done?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.53,0:14:03.49,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Get angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.70,0:14:10.45,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Get angry at all the things that \Nmade you hate your sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.81,0:14:13.42,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,At the illness that burned up her life!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.81,0:14:15.54,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,At all your relatives \Nwho didn't do a thing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.54,0:14:18.42,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,and still showed up at the funeral to cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.42,0:14:21.84,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,At the society that \Ndidn't help you at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.22,0:14:27.05,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,And if something's still worth \Nreaching out for, don't let go of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.99,0:14:33.44,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,You're human! You're gonna \Nforget eventually anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.78,0:14:45.70,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,So if you can't forget…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.77,0:14:52.54,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,then for now, why not just hold it close?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.36,0:15:07.47,italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Oh. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.87,0:15:10.28,italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.86,0:15:53.29,italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I… almost drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.94,0:15:59.57,italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,And then…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.91,0:16:12.95,flashback,young Hikaru,0,0,0,,Why are you drawing that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.70,0:16:15.66,flashback,young Hikaru,0,0,0,,Mii-chan, you meanie!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.04,0:16:18.32,flashback,young Mitsuru,0,0,0,,Hikaru…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.90,0:16:20.90,flashback,young Hikaru,0,0,0,,I'm not doing the diary anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.63,0:16:25.34,flashback,young Mitsuru,0,0,0,,You're going to stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.34,0:16:28.10,flashback,young Hikaru,0,0,0,,Yes! I'm stopping!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.10,0:16:31.98,flashback,young Mitsuru,0,0,0,,But… I love your drawings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.66,0:16:49.87,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Hikaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.81,0:16:55.99,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Hikaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.61,0:17:04.97,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I remembered, Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.72,0:17:09.92,top,Koshiba,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hotel Inhuhmans{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.57,0:17:16.34,italics,audio,0,0,0,,The true culprits are \Nburied in the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.34,0:17:19.12,italics,audio,0,0,0,,{\i0}Assassin Detective{\i1}! \NNow airing to rave reviews!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.62,0:17:22.27,main,Ikuro,0,0,0,,Huh. So that's what this is…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.27,0:17:24.06,main,Ikuro,0,0,0,,Hey, Sara-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.34,0:17:26.60,main,Sara,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.60,0:17:28.30,main,Ikuro,0,0,0,,It's Koshiba-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.30,0:17:32.07,main,Ikuro,0,0,0,,They didn't tell me \Nanything about this last job.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.72,0:17:36.51,main,Ikuro,0,0,0,,Mitsuru-sama wanted her younger sister \Nto be able to accept her death,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.51,0:17:38.74,main,Ikuro,0,0,0,,and asking us to help \Ngive her the strength
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.74,0:17:41.61,main,Ikuro,0,0,0,,was Mitsuru Matsuki-sama's last wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.08,0:17:45.06,main,Sara,0,0,0,,Oh. That was probably \Nout of embarrassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.06,0:17:47.92,main,Ikuro,0,0,0,,Really? We're talking \Nabout Koshiba-san here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.92,0:17:51.59,main,Sara,0,0,0,,They may not get as close \Nto others as you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.17,0:17:54.91,main,Sara,0,0,0,,but they probably stick with \Nother people more than you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.72,0:18:06.54,main,older sister,0,0,0,,Hey, don't run!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.61,0:18:16.32,main,Sara,0,0,0,,Koshiba is, for better or worse… \Nclumsy at certain things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.23,0:19:26.23,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Welcome in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.23,0:19:31.41,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Man, that cold wrecked your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.98,0:19:34.45,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I fell in the ocean in \Nthe middle of winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.45,0:19:36.93,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I'm lucky to even be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.93,0:19:38.59,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,My phone did die, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.50,0:19:44.00,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I've gotta buy a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.38,0:19:49.92,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Though, I was thinking of taking \Nthis chance to ditch all my relatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.19,0:19:53.92,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Sure, why not? \NBut what about the other thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.23,0:19:56.81,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Did it end up okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.79,0:19:59.61,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Oh! Hang on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.68,0:20:02.68,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Huh? What's that about?
