Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.90,0:20:16.53,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,It's a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.67,0:20:21.93,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I drew it without asking…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.49,0:20:25.96,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,but it's cute, so \Nyou'll forgive me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.43,0:20:31.14,italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,January. On the way home \Nfrom my sister's funeral,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.14,0:20:33.25,italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I went to that beach \Nfor the first time in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.95,0:20:38.88,italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,In the middle of winter, \Nlate at night, on a weirdo's bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.83,0:20:43.93,italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,It was super cold, \Nbut the wind felt good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.93,0:20:45.25,italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,It was so strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.14,0:20:50.94,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\bord0.5\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H2A457D&\3c&H232B35&\pos(336,295.333)\frz343.8\frx350\fry4}Picture Diary
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.58,0:20:50.54,main,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Hey, come on. I'm cuter than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.12,0:20:58.76,italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,And then, guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.76,0:21:02.84,italics,Hikaru,0,0,0,,I nearly drowned in the ocean again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.57,0:21:29.91,sign_generic,Credits,0,0,0,,{\fad(819,709)\an7\shad0\bord1.5\b1\fnTimes New Roman\fs16\3c&H222222&\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(17,11.333)}Translator:\NElanor Sakamoto\N\NTimer:\NMariana Martinez\N\NEditor:\NGabriella Alabanza\N\NQuality Control:\NS. Bilyeu\N\NFinal Quality Control:\NBecky Cottrill
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.22,0:22:47.64,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Time for a little break.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.84,0:22:54.64,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.47,0:22:56.65,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Hey, this…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.19,0:23:00.90,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,This is my sister's…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.04,0:23:19.07,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,What? Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.33,0:23:23.12,main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,You were still drawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.97,0:23:34.98,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\blur0.25\bord0\fnTimes New Roman\fs20\b1\an1\pos(285.201,227)}Wandering Bird
